WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.060
- When I go to a music festival in LA,

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.520
people are naked, you know?

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.660
Everyone was staring and I
was just there in my one-piece

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.720
like oh okay, I'm really exposed now.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.553
- And here we are.

00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:11.386
- And here we are.

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:12.880
(girls laughing)

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.463
(festive electronic music)

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:25.183
Hey guys, it's YB.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:26.733
- And Herbert.

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:27.566
- We're in Belgium right now

00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:29.440
and we're about to attend Tomorrowland

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.640
which is one of the biggest

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.690
EDM music festivals in the whole world.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.160
I've gone to a lot of music festivals

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.000
since I was in high school,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.640
because I really like electronic music.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.310
Going to Tomorrowland has been my dream

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.878
and finally we had the opportunity to come

00:00:39.878 --> 00:00:41.608
so I am so excited.

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:42.760
- [Herbert] Me too, as a European,

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:45.340
I have always heard a lot
of great things about it.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.128
- So, this is a three day music festival

00:00:47.128 --> 00:00:49.120
where everyone from all around the world

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.090
comes to party, it's crazy actually.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.259
I've seen pictures where
everyone's holding flags

00:00:53.259 --> 00:00:56.480
and it's literally the whole
world comes to party together.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.460
We're gonna try the different
food and drinks here

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.140
and show you guys kind of how it is

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.020
and yeah, we're gonna party!

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.520
- It's gonna be a long weekend.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.330
- Yeah, but probably the best ever.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:08.867
We're excited, let's go! (laughs)

00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:11.856
(deep house music)

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:15.240
So, we're inside Tomorrowland
and we got this little

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.830
card where we can put money in.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:19.600
They have their own cashless
currency called Pearls

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.500
and festive goers can transfer
them onto their wristbands.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.050
20 euros equal about 12.5 Pearls.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.120
We also got a map so we know where to go.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.070
As you can see, there are
16 stages which is crazy.

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:31.870
This is the biggest festival I've been to.

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:33.850
They also has this Tomorrowland app

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:35.140
where you can see the lineup

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.340
and check who's playing
where at which time.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.220
I can even create my own schedule

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:42.453
by clicking on the hearts and
here's what I made for today.

00:01:42.459 --> 00:01:45.050
(deep house music)

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:48.113
Cool thing, we have a
refreshment point here.

00:01:50.825 --> 00:01:53.363
There are hair salons, tattoo shops,

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.283
as well as a bunch of food stands.

00:01:55.439 --> 00:01:56.272
Pasta!

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:59.818
(deep house music)

00:02:01.168 --> 00:02:02.835
- Had some Mai Tais!

00:02:04.349 --> 00:02:07.266
(deep house music)

00:02:08.011 --> 00:02:11.011
(future bass music)

00:02:17.107 --> 00:02:21.380
- Ladies and gentlemen, this is our home.

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.007
This is where we started,
this is Tomorrowland!

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:30.023
(people cheering)

00:02:39.122 --> 00:02:43.122
- [YB] How long have you
been performing as DJs?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.393
Yeah.

00:02:45.138 --> 00:02:46.443
Wow!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.260
How many years have you
played at Tomorrowland?

00:02:58.289 --> 00:02:59.122
Yeah.

00:03:00.594 --> 00:03:03.261
(DJ exclaiming)

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.393
Alright, day two.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:07.962
My friend, Nikki, is here.

00:03:07.962 --> 00:03:09.173
- Hi, everyone.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.400
- One thing I have to warn you about is

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.760
we really have to walk a lot,

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:16.280
because there are 16 stages
and it's like a whole village.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.113
- I'm ready.

00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:17.946
- Yeah.

00:03:17.946 --> 00:03:21.312
(progressive techno music)

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.523
The vibe here is truly amazing.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:28.690
I've seen flags from all around the world

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:30.610
and it's definitely
different from the festivals

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:31.770
I've been to in America,

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.930
but most importantly, it's
about everyone coming together

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:36.890
in one place and enjoying it together.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.473
(melodic electronic music)

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.780
How long have you been
playing at Tomorrowland?

00:03:45.842 --> 00:03:47.283
Fourth year, nice.

00:03:55.225 --> 00:03:58.808
(melodic electronic music)

00:04:01.581 --> 00:04:03.189
Okay so it's day three

00:04:03.189 --> 00:04:05.520
and it's the last day of Tomorrowland.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.210
I can't believe we already did two days.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:08.947
Are you surviving or how are you doing?

00:04:08.947 --> 00:04:11.703
- I think more than three
days is not possible,

00:04:11.809 --> 00:04:14.150
but today we will do our best.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.500
- I think I can still party today,

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.003
although I am getting like a little tired.

00:04:19.021 --> 00:04:22.521
(electronic guitar music)

00:04:26.936 --> 00:04:27.769
So...

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.423
- Got some small eye rings already.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.780
- I have eye rings?

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:32.880
You mean dark circles?

00:04:33.045 --> 00:04:35.123
- You see my eye rings?

00:04:35.123 --> 00:04:36.857
- Yesterday, we actually tried to find

00:04:36.857 --> 00:04:38.360
one of the restaurants there,

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.570
because I heard Tomorrowland
is famous for having

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.780
actual really good restaurants on site

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.380
and apparently some of
them have Michelin star.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.550
But, we went to a couple
of restaurants there,

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.690
because again it's so far from each other

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:52.030
that you have to walk so
much to get to one place

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:53.727
and we tried to find at least two of them,

00:04:53.727 --> 00:04:55.973
but they were all booked
or closed already.

00:04:56.236 --> 00:04:58.500
So, I think today that's
gonna be our goal,

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.177
to find the restaurant
we can actually eat in.

00:05:00.177 --> 00:05:03.180
Yeah, early enough, but the food we had

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:07.223
at the food stands, we had
pasta again and you had pizza.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:08.663
That was good.

00:05:08.663 --> 00:05:09.496
- [Herbert] That was good.

00:05:09.496 --> 00:05:14.043
- Yeah, so here's our last
day and hopefully we survive.

00:05:14.043 --> 00:05:16.493
(progressive electronic music)

00:05:16.493 --> 00:05:21.493
- Hands up, hands up, hands up!

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:25.203
- How long have you been
playing at Tomorrowland?

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.203
2013?

00:05:28.801 --> 00:05:30.353
So it's been like six, seven years?

00:05:30.353 --> 00:05:34.380
- Yeah.
- Yeah, wow!

00:05:45.013 --> 00:05:46.887
Can you do the hum for us?

00:05:47.193 --> 00:05:49.860
(Ummet humming)

00:05:55.773 --> 00:05:58.523
(big room music)

00:05:59.599 --> 00:06:02.432
- Tomorrowland, thank you so much!

00:06:15.946 --> 00:06:19.196
(upbeat festive music)

00:06:39.336 --> 00:06:40.919
- This is the fish.

00:06:41.011 --> 00:06:44.261
(upbeat festive music)

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.520
So that was an amazing dinner,

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.150
I'm so glad we got to
experience this before we left

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.031
and now back to dancing.

00:07:06.031 --> 00:07:09.531
(upbeat electronic music)

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.573
Every festival holds its
own special memory for me,

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.670
but Tomorrowland was a magical experience

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:15.910
I will cherish forever.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.920
It was something I dreamed
of since high school

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.300
and finally attending
it meant so much to me.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.560
Three days full of love, dancing,

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.150
new friends from all around the world,

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:26.340
and even getting to meet
some of my favorite DJs.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.300
I'm so thankful I got to be a part of it.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.190
I recommend it to anyone who loves music

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.240
and we'll definitely be back another year.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.229
Thank you, Tomorrowland.

00:07:33.229 --> 00:07:35.979
(crowd cheering)

00:07:39.248 --> 00:07:42.748
(upbeat electronic music)

